Track 1: Uncharted Gully Road
- Story & Context: On a particularly desolate night train run to Mokpo, Minjun found a forgotten street map tucked under his seat, its ink faded and corners torn, and as the train lurched, the rhythmic scrape of its wheels against the tracks perfectly aligned with the fragmented K-R&B vocal sample he was looping, "Did you ever chart the places we couldn't find?"
