Track 2: Jeondong's Confession
- Story & Context: Jeondong, a regular on the late-night line, always sat in the same carriage, always sketching intricate mandalas, and one evening, after a particularly raw cello solo from Hayoon that seemed to echo his own silent despair, he handed Minjun a crumpled note detailing a love lost somewhere between two provincial stations, "I marked every station we passed, hoping you'd appear."
