Track 3: The Ghost Line of Gaepo-dong
- Story & Context: Legend has it, a phantom train occasionally runs on the defunct Gaepo-dong line, carrying the spirits of those who never reached their destination, and Jieun, after hearing an old woman recount the tale during a delayed service, wove her most ethereal vocals around a looping, warped cello drone, creating a myth of perpetual transit, "Do the tracks still hum your name, in the places we can't go?"
